{"id":"4b22e5dfc91ce477","group":"62","path":"62/62-ex-REC-not-WKL.md","title":"Recursive Omega Model Refutes WKL","display":"ex-REC-not-WKL — Recursive Omega Model Refutes WKL","type":"example","metadata":{"type":"example","book":"Subsystems of Second Order Arithmetic (Simpson)","book_abbrev":"62","label":"62-ex-REC-not-WKL","aliases":["62-ex-REC-not-WKL"],"display":"ex-REC-not-WKL — Recursive Omega Model Refutes WKL","depends_on":["[[62-df-REC-ARITH]]","[[62-df-omega-model]]","[[62-df-RCA0]]","[[62-df-WKL0]]","[[62-df-Tree]]","[[62-thm-minimal-omega-models]]"],"source":"Simpson, 2nd edition (2009), Example I.8.8; Remark I.10.2","source_pages":[31,36],"source_pdf_pages":[49,54]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"example"},{"key":"book","html":"Subsystems of Second Order Arithmetic (Simpson)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"62"},{"key":"label","html":"62-ex-REC-not-WKL"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>62-ex-REC-not-WKL</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"ex-REC-not-WKL — Recursive Omega Model Refutes WKL"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e2d400eef79d26fb\" href=\"?note=e2d400eef79d26fb\" title=\"62-df-REC-ARITH\">62-df-REC-ARITH</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5ed7a378ff9d39c6\" href=\"?note=5ed7a378ff9d39c6\" title=\"62-df-omega-model\">62-df-omega-model</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"dd5e8930337c8b20\" href=\"?note=dd5e8930337c8b20\" title=\"62-df-RCA0\">62-df-RCA0</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"87afe420a89e1fce\" href=\"?note=87afe420a89e1fce\" title=\"62-df-WKL0\">62-df-WKL0</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"bb825000fd9a8272\" href=\"?note=bb825000fd9a8272\" title=\"62-df-Tree\">62-df-Tree</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"eea6fa5291974166\" href=\"?note=eea6fa5291974166\" title=\"62-thm-minimal-omega-models\">62-thm-minimal-omega-models</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"Simpson, 2nd edition (2009), Example I.8.8; Remark I.10.2"},{"key":"source_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>31</span><span>36</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>49</span><span>54</span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>集合族、模型、树与理论分别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"e2d400eef79d26fb\" href=\"?note=e2d400eef79d26fb\" title=\"62-df-REC-ARITH\">62-df-REC-ARITH</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"5ed7a378ff9d39c6\" href=\"?note=5ed7a378ff9d39c6\" title=\"62-df-omega-model\">62-df-omega-model</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"bb825000fd9a8272\" href=\"?note=bb825000fd9a8272\" title=\"62-df-Tree\">62-df-Tree</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"dd5e8930337c8b20\" href=\"?note=dd5e8930337c8b20\" title=\"62-df-RCA0\">62-df-RCA0</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"87afe420a89e1fce\" href=\"?note=87afe420a89e1fce\" title=\"62-df-WKL0\">62-df-WKL0</a>；最小模型事实见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"eea6fa5291974166\" href=\"?note=eea6fa5291974166\" title=\"62-thm-minimal-omega-models\">62-thm-minimal-omega-models</a>。</p>\n<p>上游理论为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RCA}_0,\\mathrm{WKL}_0\">\\(\\mathrm{RCA}_0,\\mathrm{WKL}_0\\)</span>，模型集合族为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{REC}\">\\(\\mathrm{REC}\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ex\\text{-}REC\\text{-}not\\text{-}WKL}\\vdash\\;\\operatorname{OmegaModelOf}(\\mathcal M_{\\mathrm{REC}},\\mathrm{RCA}_0)\\land\n\\neg\\operatorname{OmegaModelOf}(\\mathcal M_{\\mathrm{REC}},\\mathrm{WKL}_0).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{ex\\text{-}REC\\text{-}not\\text{-}WKL}\\vdash\\;\\operatorname{OmegaModelOf}(\\mathcal M_{\\mathrm{REC}},\\mathrm{RCA}_0)\\land\n\\neg\\operatorname{OmegaModelOf}(\\mathcal M_{\\mathrm{REC}},\\mathrm{WKL}_0).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>具体见证来自两个递归不可分的互不相交 c.e. 集的枚举 f、g：令长度 k 的二进制结点 s 满足所有 m,n&lt;k 的约束 f(m)=n⇒s(n)=1、g(m)=n⇒s(n)=0。得到递归无限二叉树；任何路径分开这两个集合，故不递归。这个外部见证在 REC 中没有路径，给出 RCA₀ 与 WKL₀ 的模型分离。不是说该树在全模型中无路径。</p>\n<p>来源：第二版（2009），Example I.8.8; Remark I.10.2；纸面页 31, 36；PDF 页 49, 54。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"62-df-REC-ARITH","status":"resolved","id":"e2d400eef79d26fb","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[62-df-REC-ARITH]]","embed":false},{"target":"62-df-omega-model","status":"resolved","id":"5ed7a378ff9d39c6","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[62-df-omega-model]]","embed":false},{"target":"62-df-RCA0","status":"resolved","id":"dd5e8930337c8b20","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[62-df-RCA0]]","embed":false},{"target":"62-df-WKL0","status":"resolved","id":"87afe420a89e1fce","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[62-df-WKL0]]","embed":false},{"target":"62-df-Tree","status":"resolved","id":"bb825000fd9a8272","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[62-df-Tree]]","embed":false},{"target":"62-thm-minimal-omega-models","status":"resolved","id":"eea6fa5291974166","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[62-thm-minimal-omega-models]]","embed":false},{"target":"62-df-REC-ARITH","status":"resolved","id":"e2d400eef79d26fb","anchor":"ref-7